    "problemStatement": "Given a string containing only digits, restore all possible valid IPv4 addresses by inserting three dots into the string. Each segment must be between 0 and 255 and cannot contain leading zeros unless the segment itself is 0. Return all valid IP addresses in lexicographical order.",
